    "content": "* Request-fulfillment from conversations workflow: When a task involves responding to or fulfilling a request found in text messages or emails: (1) Fetch the COMPLETE conversation thread with the requester (use `show_text_message_window` or paginate `search_text_messages` filtered by their phone number — do NOT rely on truncated search results). (2) Read ALL messages from the requester to extract their EXACT ask, including any qualifiers (specific director, genre, price range, date, quantity, etc.). (3) Write out the extracted criteria explicitly as an intermediate artifact before proceeding. (4) Fetch source data (notes, lists, etc.) and apply ALL extracted filters. (5) Before sending the response, verify: the items included match the filtered set, NOT the full unfiltered source."
